    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Fill the tank to exactly 25% capacity before loading. This reduces fuel spillage risk and complies with safety guidelines for long‑distance transport. For bike parcel services in Tirupur or other regional hubs, this rule also helps in maintaining a consistent weight distribution, which is crucial for air or rail transport.</p>
